  "prefLabel": "Env-A 903.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 903.01 Applicability.\n\n(a) Except as provided in (b), below, this part shall apply to any stationary source, area source, or device that is subject to Env-A 600.\n\n(b) The owner or operator of any of the following stationary sources, area sources, or devices shall not be required to comply with the requirements of this part with respect to that source or device:\n\n(1) A device that is not subject to Env-A 600 that is located at a source that is subject to Env-A 600;\n\n(2) A source or device that is an exempt or insignificant activity pursuant to Env-A 609.03 or Env-A 609.04, respectively; or\n\n(3) A source or device that is operated under a permit-by-notification issued pursuant to Env-A 603.02.\n\nSource. #1717, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss by #5505, eff 11-15-92, EXPIRED: 11-15-98\n\nNew. #6892, INTERIM, eff 11-26-98, EXPIRED: 3-26-99\n\nNew. #6983-B, eff 4-23-99; ss by #7973, eff 10-21-03; ss by #8872, eff 4-21-07; amd by #9792, eff 10-1-10; ss by #10892, eff 7-18-15; ss by #14374, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a900.html"
